# Paths excluded from the vaultcheck citation scan.
# Every entry MUST carry a trailing reason comment; an entry without one fails the check.
# Format: one fnmatch glob per line, matched against repository-relative POSIX paths.
# Decision: ADR-0004 (citation scan scope).

specs/**                      # spec prose and contracts cite example identifiers by design
docs/vault/templates/**       # templates carry placeholder identifiers that are meant to be replaced
tests/fixtures/**             # fixture vaults contain deliberately broken citations to exercise the checker
